","illustrator":"Rajiv Eipe","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2018"},{"page":8,"title":"Dog barks at garbage collector","illustrator":"Rajiv Eipe","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2018"},{"page":9,"title":"man worried seeing the garbage","illustrator":"Rajiv Eipe","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2018"},{"page":10,"title":"small boy bringing the dustbins","illustrator":"Rajiv Eipe","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2018"},{"page":11,"title":"man dumping the garbage into the truck","illustrator":"Rajiv Eipe","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2018"},{"page":12,"title":"man and child beating buckets and dancing","illustrator":"Rajiv Eipe","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2018"},{"page":13,"title":"boy waving bye to the man","illustrator":"Rajiv Eipe","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2018"},{"page":14,"title":"man telling bye and driving","illustrator":"Rajiv Eipe","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2018"},{"page":15,"title":"man driving away with garbage","illustrator":"Rajiv Eipe","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2018"},{"page":18,"title":"man drives the trash vehicle","illustrator":"Rajiv Eipe","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2018"}],"retrieved":"2026-09-19"},"pages":[{"n":1,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/52566-aanand/p01.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":[]},{"n":2,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/52566-aanand/p02.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಹಾಯ್! ನಾನು ಆನಂದ್."]},{"n":3,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/52566-aanand/p03.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["ಇಲ್ಲಿರುವ ಮನೆಗಳಿಂದ ಕಸ ಕಲೆ ಹಾಕುವುದು ನಾನೇ."]},{"n":4,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/52566-aanand/p04.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["ನಾನು ತಡವಾಗಿ ಬಂದಾಗೆಲ್ಲ, ಮಿಸೆಸ್ ಮಸ್ಕರೇನಸ್ ಗೆ ಕೋಪ ಬಂದುಬಿಡುತ್ತೆ."]},{"n":5,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/52566-aanand/p05.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["ಉನ್ನಿ ಅಂಕಲ್ ಚೂರು ಪಾರು ಕಸವನ್ನೂ ನಾನು ಎತ್ತಿಕೊಂಡೆನಾ ಅಂತಾ ನೋಡುತ್ತಾರೆ."]},{"n":6,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/52566-aanand/p06.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["ಅನಿತಾ ಆಂಟಿ ಮೂಗು ತುಂಬಾ ಚುರುಕು!"]},{"n":7,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/52566-aanand/p07.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["ಆ ನಾಲ್ಕನೇ ಕ್ರಾಸ್ ಗೆ ಹೊಸದಾಗಿ ಬಂದಿರುವ ಜನ ಸ್ನೇಹಪರರು. ಆದರೆ, ಆ ನಾಯಿಯೋ!"]},{"n":8,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/52566-aanand/p08.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["ಅಯ್ಯೋ! ಇವನ್ನೆಲ್ಲಾ ತೆಗೆಯೋಕೆ ಇಡೀ ದಿನವೇ ಬೇಕು!"]},{"n":9,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/52566-aanand/p09.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["ಸಲೀಂ ಇರುವ ಬೀದಿಗೆ ಹೋಗುವುದು ನನಗಿಷ್ಟ."]},{"n":10,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/52566-aanand/p10.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["ಸಲೀಂ ಮತ್ತು ನಾನು ಸ್ನೇಹಿತರು."]},{"n":11,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/52566-aanand/p11.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["ಅವನಿಗೆ ಡ್ರಮ್ ಬಾರಿಸುವುದು ಇಷ್ಟ. ನನಗೆ ಕುಣಿಯಲು ಇಷ್ಟ."]},{"n":12,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/52566-aanand/p12.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["ಸಮಯ ಹೋಗುವುದೇ ಗೊತ್ತಾಗಲ್ಲ."]},{"n":13,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/52566-aanand/p13.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["ನಾನಿನ್ನು ಬರ್ಲಾ!"]},{"n":14,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/52566-aanand/p14.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":[]}],"wordCount":69}